// `#[derive(Eq, Hash, Ord, Clone)]` (and `#[Debug]`): field-by-field `==`, `<`, `hash`, `clone`. A struct
// gets methods, an enum `#[impl]` fns per variant, a generic enum generic fns instantiated per instance.
//
// Part of module j3c.sema.
// Port of: j3c/src/check/derive.rs
// J3: Builds typed-tree nodes directly (plan 11 B11.4), not J3 source parsed back. Each derived method is
// an instance request (`instances`); every node's span is the derive name, so an error in a generated body
// (a field without `hash`) still points at `#[derive(Hash)]` with Rust's text.
module j3c.sema;
